Z||000001||Oreif||03-22-2001||05:29 PM||||The Fastback model is the 1986 thru 1988 GT.<BR>Most 1986 GT's were the muncie 4-spd. But starting in June of 1986 they started putting in the Getreg 5-spd. Some some of the later 1986's had the 5-spd. All 1987 and 1988 GT's came with the 5-spd.<P>You can check out the "Mall" section or go to <A HREF="http://www.traderonline.com" TARGET=_blank>www.traderonline.com</A>  and search for Fiero GT 1987 and 1988. <P>Here is an ad that was posted in the Mall section:<BR>1988 Fireo GT<BR>Description: collector owned,no rain or snow,like new,5 sp.,air,rare color yellow,bra,am-fm,goodyear tires,all original,garage stored from new,stored last 3 years,show room condition. <BR>Date Posted: 03/21/01 <BR>Sold As: By Owner <BR>Price: $ 6,500.00 (Firm) <BR>Category: Two-Door Coupe <BR>Color: Yellow <BR>Mileage: 18,000 <BR>Condition: New <P>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------<P>Contact: john maslak <BR>Email: jmazz13@yahoo.com Reply to this ad <BR>Phone (Leave Message): (814) 754-5507 <BR>Phone (Day): (814) 241-4637 <BR>Location: box 1027<BR>Somerset, PA 15501 <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 03-22-2001).]||||reg||1
